{"about_the_game":"<strong>Can you manage to beat your competitors to be the next top idol- and maybe even win their hearts in the process?</strong><br><br>Alice just wanted to get through her internship- but when a contestant drops right before the first episode of the idol contest she's working at, she's forced into the stage light. Can she make it to the top or will she be eliminated?<br><br><i>Alice in Stardom</i> is a free 3~ hour long visual novel about Alice, a young intern working at Supernova, an idol competition when she's forced to be a competitor last minute. Now that she's in the competition, you get to determine whether she'll rise to the top or be eliminated. This game features 3 light dating sim routes to pick from where you can spend time with any girl you like and receive a different ending depending on which one you bond with the most.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 40,000+ words<br></li><li> 3 girls to spend time with<br></li><li> Concert minigames<br></li><li> Beautiful guest art cut scenes<br></li><li> Completely free!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"3f4bcc6f5cc980c68ff4845702da0473f12fb8ab.jpg","localized_name":"Humble Beginnings","name":"Humble Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1054560/3f4bcc6f5cc980c68ff4845702da0473f12fb8ab.jpg"},{"icon":"1b74db0bf91eda8b54486011da59fcbaec8d5f82.jpg","localized_name":"First Steps","name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1054560/1b74db0bf91eda8b54486011da59fcbaec8d5f82.jpg"},{"icon":"27342767fa7afdfab4cdfd7c9bd11b1bcda0108e.jpg","localized_name":"Cold Feet","name":"Cold Feet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1054560/27342767fa7afdfab4cdfd7c9bd11b1bcda0108e.jpg"},{"icon":"1b674fdf9a3baf00a6b3531bab48f133a9ba4a84.jpg","localized_name":"Through the Darkness","name":"Through the Darkness","path":"https://cdn.a